        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-725-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH726-GF-MULT-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH727-RS-CODEC-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH728-GF-LAT-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
